    "sections": {
        "description": "The Design Studio theme is created for agencies, creative professionals, architecture firms, and corporate businesses that need a clean and organized online presence. It includes structured layouts for portfolio displays, service sections, team profiles, testimonials, and contact information. The responsive design ensures smooth viewing across desktops, tablets, and mobile devices. Customization features allow users to adjust colors, typography, banners, and page layouts according to project requirements. The theme also supports animation effects, blog sections, image galleries, and call-to-action areas for presenting creative work and business updates clearly. Suitable for a modern studio, freelancer, branding agency, or design-focused company, the layout provides a professional framework for showcasing projects, visual content, architecture concepts, and creative services in a functional and accessible format."
    },
